OL,3,A9/11 victims remembered 25 years on
OL,4,Afrom attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew York leaders and former Mayor Rudy
OL,7,FGiuliani have begun arriving at the
OL,8,FWorld Trade Center ahead of services
OL,9,Fthat will be held to mark the 25th
OL,10,Fanniversary of the 9/11 attacks in the
OL,11,FUnited States
OL,13,FOn 11 September 2001, 2,977 people were
OL,14,Fkilled when hijackers crashed two
OL,15,Fplanes into the Twin Towers of the
OL,16,FWorld Trade Center in New York
OL,18,FAnother hijacked plane hit the Pentagon
OL,19,Fnear Washington DC. A fourth crashed in
OL,20,Fa field in Pennsylvania after
OL,21,Fpassengers fought back
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
